              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अंशतः — aṁśataḥ — \"partly\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "तुमचं म्हणणं अंशतः खरं आहे. tumcaṁ mhaṇṇaṁ aṁśataḥ kharaṁ āhe. What you say is partly true."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Formal; अंश, a part."
            }
          ]
        },
